     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Hi, don&#39;t use the hard bounds &lt;lower=-15, upper=20&gt; etc. on the parameters.  If you have prior information, put it in as continuous priors (usually we just use normal distributions).  Also, don&#39;t use uniform distributions.<div>A</div><div><br><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ],
